keel-overlay-crowdsec (0.1.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The manifest names no confconsole screen. It named
    /usr/lib/confconsole/plugins.d/Security/crowdsec.py, a file that no
    confconsole installs, and confconsole has no CrowdSec screen. keel
    needs a screen only for an overlay state ask, which CrowdSec does not
    have. tests/overlay-install.bats checks that each screen an overlay
    manifest names is a file that confconsole installs.

